{
  "file_id": "3552",
  "text_count": 206,
  "dialog": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "english": "He's our lord, ribbit.",
      "_offset": 1866,
      "_length": 22,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "english": "He's been stuck like this for 300\nyears, ribbit. Ever since he lost\na karaoke match, ribbit.",
      "_offset": 1889,
      "_length": 92,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "english": "To wake up, he needs to hear a\nsinging voice more beautiful than\nthe one that defeated him, ribbit.",
      "_offset": 1982,
      "_length": 99,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "english": "I see...Come to think of it, I\nrecently saw a girl who's an\namazing singer.",
      "_offset": 2082,
      "_length": 75,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "english": "Really, ribbit?!",
      "_offset": 2158,
      "_length": 16,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "english": "Thank you, ribbit!",
      "_offset": 2175,
      "_length": 18,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "english": "No problem! Heeheehee...",
      "_offset": 2194,
      "_length": 24,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "english": "Hang in there, Mimi!",
      "_offset": 2219,
      "_length": 20,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "english": "I don't wanna hang in there! I\nwanna drink water and eat and take\na bath!",
      "_offset": 2240,
      "_length": 73,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "english": "Don't be so selfish!",
      "_offset": 2314,
      "_length": 20,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "english": "There she is, ribbit!",
      "_offset": 2335,
      "_length": 21,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "english": "Is thish the amazing shinger,\ntama?",
      "_offset": 2357,
      "_length": 35,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "english": "What do you want?",
      "_offset": 2396,
      "_length": 17,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "english": "Please-ribbit... we want you to\ncure our lord, ribbit!",
      "_offset": 2414,
      "_length": 54,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "english": "We require a beautiful shinging\nvoice to awaken our lord, tama!",
      "_offset": 2469,
      "_length": 63,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "english": "So, you need me?",
      "_offset": 2533,
      "_length": 16,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "english": "Yes, ribbit! We were told that\nyou're an amazing singer, ribbit.",
      "_offset": 2550,
      "_length": 64,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "english": "We would very much like for you to\ncome to the castle, tama!",
      "_offset": 2615,
      "_length": 60,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "english": "A castle?! Wow!",
      "_offset": 2676,
      "_length": 15,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "english": "Mimi, it looks like they're in\ntrouble. Should we help them?",
      "_offset": 2692,
      "_length": 60,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "english": "But like I said, I can't walk\nanymore!",
      "_offset": 2753,
      "_length": 38,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "english": "That's a shame, ribbit. We were\ngonna offer you our best \nhospitality, ribbit.",
      "_offset": 2792,
      "_length": 78,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "english": "We even got a fluffy bed ready,\ntama...",
      "_offset": 2871,
      "_length": 39,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "english": "Really?! That does it! I'll go to\nthe castle!",
      "_offset": 2911,
      "_length": 45,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "english": "You're really self-absorbed,\nMimi...",
      "_offset": 2957,
      "_length": 36,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "english": "Heeheeheehee...now the Crest of\nPurity will never glow.",
      "_offset": 2994,
      "_length": 55,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "english": "So, we're counting on you, ribbit!",
      "_offset": 3050,
      "_length": 34,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "english": "We'll be waiting for you, tama!",
      "_offset": 3085,
      "_length": 31,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "english": "All right, then, let's get psyched\nup and go!",
      "_offset": 3117,
      "_length": 45,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "english": "Okay, now you're fired up!",
      "_offset": 3163,
      "_length": 26,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "english": "Welcome, ribbit!",
      "_offset": 3190,
      "_length": 16,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "english": "You really did come to help, tama!",
      "_offset": 3207,
      "_length": 34,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "english": "Wow, it was a lot further than I\nthought.",
      "_offset": 3242,
      "_length": 41,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "english": "I definitely wanna rest for a\nbit...",
      "_offset": 3284,
      "_length": 36,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "english": "Please come in, ribbit!",
      "_offset": 3321,
      "_length": 23,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "english": "How's the Digivice looking,\nTai?",
      "_offset": 3345,
      "_length": 35,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "english": "No doubt about it, there's someone\nhere! Let's keep going.",
      "_offset": 3381,
      "_length": 58,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "english": "Tai! Look!",
      "_offset": 3440,
      "_length": 13,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "english": "That's a really fancy castle!",
      "_offset": 3454,
      "_length": 29,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "english": "H-help us, ribbit!",
      "_offset": 3484,
      "_length": 18,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "english": "Please, tama!",
      "_offset": 3503,
      "_length": 13,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "english": "A frog and a tadpole? What's going\non?",
      "_offset": 3517,
      "_length": 38,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "english": "We'll tell you more in the castle,\nribbit. Come inside, ribbit.",
      "_offset": 3556,
      "_length": 63,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "english": "I see, you're trying to cure your\nlord, but the girl's causing you\ntrouble instead.",
      "_offset": 3620,
      "_length": 83,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "english": "As soon as you hear the princess\nsaying she wants mixed fried\nrice...",
      "_offset": 3704,
      "_length": 69,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "english": "...the next minute she shays she\nwants a polka-dot dressh, tama.",
      "_offset": 3774,
      "_length": 64,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "english": "A princess driving her servants\nthis crazy, huh.",
      "_offset": 3839,
      "_length": 48,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "english": "She must be a really selfish girl.",
      "_offset": 3888,
      "_length": 34,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "english": "The princess has arrived,\nribbit-ribbit!",
      "_offset": 3923,
      "_length": 40,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "english": "Mimi!",
      "_offset": 3964,
      "_length": 5,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "english": "Mimi!",
      "_offset": 3970,
      "_length": 5,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "english": "Guys! It's been a while!",
      "_offset": 3976,
      "_length": 24,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "english": "What are you doing here?!",
      "_offset": 4001,
      "_length": 25,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "english": "What? Can't you see? I'm being a\nprincess!",
      "_offset": 4027,
      "_length": 42,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "english": "Well, we're glad you're safe.",
      "_offset": 4070,
      "_length": 29,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "english": "All right, let's hurry up and go!",
      "_offset": 4100,
      "_length": 33,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "english": "Huuuuuuh? Why do I have to go?",
      "_offset": 4134,
      "_length": 30,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "english": "Why, what's wrong?",
      "_offset": 4165,
      "_length": 18,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "english": "I'm not going!",
      "_offset": 4184,
      "_length": 14,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "english": "Whaaaaaat?!",
      "_offset": 4199,
      "_length": 11,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "english": "We can't guarantee that we can go\nback to our world, so why should I\nput myself in danger?",
      "_offset": 4211,
      "_length": 90,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "english": "Hey, Mimi...",
      "_offset": 4302,
      "_length": 12,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "english": "I've got everything here! A bath,\na fluffy bed, food!",
      "_offset": 4315,
      "_length": 53,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "english": "Guys! You came!",
      "_offset": 4369,
      "_length": 15,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "english": "Palmon, go and set her straight!",
      "_offset": 4385,
      "_length": 32,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "english": "Mimi, why are you mad?",
      "_offset": 4418,
      "_length": 22,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "english": "Be quiet, Palmon!",
      "_offset": 4441,
      "_length": 17,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "english": "If you don't have any other\nbusiness, leave! Here, escort\nthese people out!",
      "_offset": 4459,
      "_length": 75,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "english": "Aaaaaaaah! Hey, look...",
      "_offset": 4535,
      "_length": 23,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "english": "Aaaaaaaaaaaaaah!",
      "_offset": 4559,
      "_length": 16,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "english": "That huuuuuurt!",
      "_offset": 4576,
      "_length": 15,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "english": "Anyway, what on earth happened to\nMimi?",
      "_offset": 4592,
      "_length": 39,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "english": "She's gotten the wrong idea in her\nhead because of how much those\nfrogs are spoiling her!",
      "_offset": 4632,
      "_length": 89,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "english": "We're sorry about earlier, ribbit.",
      "_offset": 4722,
      "_length": 34,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "english": "We can't disobey the prinshess,\ntama.",
      "_offset": 4757,
      "_length": 37,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "english": "I know you've got a major problem,\nbut you can't solve it by just\nplaying along.",
      "_offset": 4795,
      "_length": 80,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "english": "Ah, well. So, what do we do now?",
      "_offset": 4876,
      "_length": 32,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "english": "Doesn't seem like Mimi plans to\nhelp your lord out.",
      "_offset": 4909,
      "_length": 51,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "english": "It might be easier if we just get\nhim to listen to her song.",
      "_offset": 4961,
      "_length": 60,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "english": "Is that even possible?",
      "_offset": 5022,
      "_length": 22,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "english": "Ah! We'll bug Mimi's room with\nrecording equipment and record her\nsong!",
      "_offset": 5045,
      "_length": 71,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "english": "But how are we going to get into\nMimi's room without her noticing?",
      "_offset": 5120,
      "_length": 66,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "english": "There's an emergency passage\nunderneath the hallway that leads\ninto her room, ribbit.",
      "_offset": 5187,
      "_length": 85,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "english": "Really?!",
      "_offset": 5273,
      "_length": 8,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "english": "Then we have to get a recording\ndevice, but...",
      "_offset": 5282,
      "_length": 46,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "english": "Don't worry about that, tama.",
      "_offset": 5329,
      "_length": 29,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "english": "Long ago, our lord bought one to\npractice karaoke. It's in the\nunderground shtoreroom, tama.",
      "_offset": 5359,
      "_length": 92,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "english": "We'll find a way to pull this off,\nTai!",
      "_offset": 5452,
      "_length": 42,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "english": "Yeah! Otamamon, Gekomon, can you\nguide us through the passage?",
      "_offset": 5495,
      "_length": 62,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "english": "Got it, ribbit!",
      "_offset": 5558,
      "_length": 15,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "english": "But there are elite troops in the\nunderground passage who adore the\nprinshess, tama.",
      "_offset": 5574,
      "_length": 84,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "english": "Okay, leave them to us!",
      "_offset": 5659,
      "_length": 23,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "english": "Here's the recording device!",
      "_offset": 5683,
      "_length": 28,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "english": "All right, we can use this!",
      "_offset": 5712,
      "_length": 27,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "english": "That's great, Tai!",
      "_offset": 5740,
      "_length": 21,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "english": "You! What're you doing, ribbit!",
      "_offset": 5762,
      "_length": 31,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "english": "Suspicious guys! Come quietly,\nribbit!",
      "_offset": 5794,
      "_length": 38,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "english": "Uh-oh! We got caught!",
      "_offset": 5833,
      "_length": 21,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "english": "Leave it to us!",
      "_offset": 5855,
      "_length": 15,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 99,
      "english": "We did it, Agumon!",
      "_offset": 5871,
      "_length": 18,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 100,
      "english": "You saved us, Gomamon!",
      "_offset": 5890,
      "_length": 22,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 101,
      "english": "Okay, let's hurry back!",
      "_offset": 5913,
      "_length": 23,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 102,
      "english": "All right, let's head to Mimi's\nroom!",
      "_offset": 5937,
      "_length": 37,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 103,
      "english": "Start recording!",
      "_offset": 5975,
      "_length": 16,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 104,
      "english": "This'll be perfect!",
      "_offset": 5992,
      "_length": 19,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 105,
      "english": "Go wait in the next room, ribbit!",
      "_offset": 6012,
      "_length": 33,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 106,
      "english": "We'll leave the rest to you!",
      "_offset": 6046,
      "_length": 28,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 107,
      "english": "*yawn* This castle is comfy, but\nI'm bored.",
      "_offset": 6075,
      "_length": 43,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 108,
      "english": "Princess!",
      "_offset": 6119,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 109,
      "english": "Ah, what's wrong?",
      "_offset": 6129,
      "_length": 17,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 110,
      "english": "If you're bored, would you like to\ndo some karaoke?",
      "_offset": 6147,
      "_length": 51,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 111,
      "english": "I don't really feel like it.",
      "_offset": 6199,
      "_length": 28,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 112,
      "english": "Oh, no! I want to hear the\nprincess singing, ribbit!",
      "_offset": 6228,
      "_length": 52,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 113,
      "english": "Well, then...just a little...",
      "_offset": 6281,
      "_length": 29,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
